  rationale "Linear and polynomial equation solving, Fibonacci references and the box, motion and train word problems the calculator normalizes. Issue #658 cut this module out of one oversized worker file by line count; R1188-U5 named it after what it holds. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1195 to 1206 when plan 10 L20 retired conversational phrase families onto declared roles and the mirror arms followed. Ceiling 1242 (2026-10-07, R1017): rewriteMathFunctionPhrases turns a spelled function application ('the square root of 144') into call syntax, twin of rust/src/calculation/function_phrase.rs. Ceiling 1245 (2026-10-07, PR #1188): extractJavaScriptProgram reads the program after the request's colon (`Run this JavaScript: console.log(1 + 2)`), mirroring rust/src/solver_helpers/code.rs extract_javascript_program. Ceiling moved 1245 to 1247 (R1188-U5): the first comment lines say what the module holds."
